{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q5283603","formula":"S₂","hill":"S2","elements":["S"],"composition":{"S":2.0},"names":{"en":"Disulfur","ru":"Дисера"},"descriptions":{"en":"Disulfur is the diatomic molecule consisting of two sulfur atoms with the formula S2. It is analogous to the dioxygen molecule but rarely occurs at room temperature. This violet gas is the dominant species in hot sulfur vapors.","ru":"Дисера — химическое соединение, состоящее из двух атомов серы соединённых двойной связью с химической формулой S2. Она аналогична молекуле дикислорода (O2), но редко встречается при комнатной температуре. Этот фиолетовый газ является доминирующим в горячих парах серы."},"fame":15,"pubchemCid":5460602,"mass":64.13,"charge":0,"smiles":"S=S","inchikey":"MAHNFPMIPQKPPI-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":null,"classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"5460602","atoms":2,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-0.926,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"S"},{"x":0.926,"y":0.0,"z":0.0,"el":"S"}],"bonds":[[0,1,2]]},"sources":[{"role":"identity","name":"Wikidata","url":"https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q5283603","license":"CC0 1.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (en)","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Disulfur","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"description","name":"Wikipedia (ru)","url":"https://ru.wikipedia.org/wiki/%D0%94%D0%B8%D1%81%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B0","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"role":"properties","name":"PubChem","url":"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/5460602","license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},{"role":"structure","name":"PubChem 3D","url":"https://pubchem.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/compound/5460602#section=3D-Conformer","license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"}],"similar":[{"id":"Q7076759","formula":"S₈","names":{"en":"Octasulfur","ru":"Октасера"},"elements":["S"],"fame":16,"kind":"molecul